<title>SINGAPORE: About 7.2 mln Steamers shares to be listed.</title>
<headline>About 7.2 mln Steamers shares to be listed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>An additional 7.2 million ordinary shares of Singapore $0.20 each in Steamers Maritime Holdings Ltd would be listed on Wednesday, the Stock Exchange of Singapore (SES) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Straits Steamship Land Ltd and Far East Levingston Shipbuilding Ltd had earlier signed agreements to sell their respective 20 percent stakes in Keppel Telecoms Pte Ltd to Steamers Maritime. Steamers will pay for the acquisition by issuing the new shares.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703083) at</p>
</text>
